#: includes/Classes/License_Manager.php:1679
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sUrgent!%2$s This Wholesale Suite license key has been disabled. This "
"could be due to a number of reasons:"
msgstr ""
"%1$sDringend!%2$s Dieser Wholesale Suite-Lizenzschlüssel wurde deaktiviert. "
"Dies kann verschiedene Ursachen haben:"

#: includes/Classes/License_Manager.php:1687
msgid "A refund or chargeback was initiated against this license key"
msgstr ""
"Eine Rückerstattung oder Rückbuchung wurde für diesen Lizenzschlüssel "
"eingeleitet"

#: includes/Classes/License_Manager.php:1688
msgid "The license key may have violated our Terms of Service"
msgstr ""
"Der Lizenzschlüssel hat möglicherweise gegen unsere Nutzungsbedingungen "
"verstoßen"

#: includes/Classes/License_Manager.php:1689
msgid ""
"There may have been a malfunction with the license key and this is a false "
